            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Acute surgical conditions of the abdomen are heralded by pain, and can occur in patients hospitalized for unrelated reasons. A thorough history and physical examination, aided by certain laboratory and radiographic studies, are essential in making a correct diagnosis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
